OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle house fire which
OL,4,Aspreads to roofs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have tackled a blaze which
OL,7,Fbadly damaged at least two houses.
OL,9,FBedfordshire Fire Service was called to
OL,10,FWinchester Road in Sandy at about 14:00
OL,11,FBST.
OL,13,FResidents nearby were advised to keep
OL,14,Ftheir windows and doors shut, while the
OL,15,Froad was closed for several hours.
OL,17,FCrews were able to leave the scene by
OL,18,Fabout 19:30, said a fire service
OL,19,Fspokesperson.
